  "content": "[Intro]\n[D]\n[A6]\n[Gm]\n[D]\n[A6]\n[Em/G]\n[Bm]\nShall I\n\n[Verse 1]\n[D]tell you about my life\n[A6]They\n[Gm]say I'm a man of the\n[D]world I've\nflown across every tide\n[A6]\n[Em/G]And I've seen lots of pretty\n[Bm]girls\n[Gm]\n[D]\nI guess I've\n\n[Verse 2]\n[D]got everything I need\n[A6]\n[Gm]I wouldn't ask for more\n[D]And there's\nno one I'd rather be\n[A6]\n[Em/G]But I just wish that I'd\n[Bm]never been born\n[Gm]\n[D]\n\n[Solo]\n[D]\n[A6]\n[Gm]\n[D]\n[A6]\n[Gm]\n[D]And I need a good\n\n[Bridge]\n[F#m]woman\nTo make me feel like a\n[Em]good man should\n[F#m]I don't say I'm a good man\nOh, but I would be\n[Em]if I could\n[A6]I could\n\n[Verse 3]\n[D]tell you about my life\n[A6]And\n[Gm]keep you amused I'm sure\n[D]A-\nbout all the times I've cried\n[A6]\n[Em/G]And how I don't want to be\n[Bm]sad anymore\n[Gm]\n[D]\n\n[Outro]\n[F#m]\n[Em]\n[F#m]\n[Em]\n[D]",
